WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.150
Lots of things can cause a dry mouth,

00:03.150 --> 00:05.400
leaving you feeling uncomfortable.

00:05.500 --> 00:08.900
Without enough saliva,
everyday moments get harder.

00:08.900 --> 00:10.300
Speaking.

00:10.400 --> 00:11.900
Eating.

00:12.400 --> 00:14.200
Even sleeping.

00:14.700 --> 00:17.300
Healthy saliva is more than water.

00:17.600 --> 00:22.000
A thin layer of natural lipids coats your mouth,
and holds moisture in.

00:25.400 --> 00:27.800
Aquoral works the same way.

00:29.400 --> 00:34.700
In a clinical survey, 92% of people
saw their dry mouth symptoms improve.

00:34.900 --> 00:36.900
Two quick sprays…

00:36.900 --> 00:38.700
…spread into a protective lipid film…

00:38.700 --> 00:41.000
…that lubricates your mouth
and slows moisture loss.

00:43.100 --> 00:48.500
Its oxidized glycerol triesters trace back
to research at France's Institut Pasteur.

00:48.600 --> 00:49.500
So you can talk…

00:49.500 --> 00:50.700
…laugh…

00:50.900 --> 00:53.000
…and enjoy a meal more comfortably…

00:53.000 --> 00:55.500
…with relief that lasts four to six hours.

00:57.200 --> 01:01.100
Small enough for your pocket.
Two canisters in every box.

01:02.000 --> 01:06.200
Aquoral. Moisture that stays.
Now in Canada.
